    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that including CO2 and CH4 emissions from permafrost thaw makes global emission budgets path-dependent, meaning the remaining carbon budget for a climate target is significantly reduced and depends on the specific warming pathway followed, especially in overshoot scenarios.",
